## Required Changes

### Change #1: add the catalogue entry phrasing the time-budget then step

**Document:** `docs/product/product.yaml`

**Action:** Append this entry to the end of the `catalogue:` list (it becomes
the fourth entry, after `the service answers "{reply}"`). Keep the existing
